  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.1.4: Fixed the dashboard's language picker and RTL/LTR direction toggle being able to disagree with each other -- switching to Farsi now always switches direction to rtl (and English to ltr), and toggling direction now always switches the language to match, instead of requiring both controls to be set by hand. UI-only fix (rebuilt dashboard bundle); no API changes. Previous (0.1.3): fixed a cold-start race condition present since real ingestion landed: NafasIngestionWriterHostedService could attempt a database write before schema creation had actually finished, logging \"SQLite Error 1: no such table: nafas_logs\" and silently dropping that batch of logs/metrics/traces. Ingestion hosted-service registration order now genuinely guarantees schema exists first.",
